------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Presentations of groups
--
-- Stored matrices of the local circuits of Lemma D.8, as literals
--
-- The payload checks of GeneralN.CForm multiply the matrices of the
-- local circuits on the wires 0, 1, 2.  Recomputing ⟦ c ⟧M at every use
-- costs about a second per gate of c; so each is given here as a
-- literal trie, generated exactly over ℤ[√2] (scratchpad genmat.py),
-- with its definition proved once — the long ones through the short
-- ones, a product of literals being cheap.
------------------------------------------------------------------------

